id: sl_rail_util_built_in_phys
label: RAIL Utility, Built-in PHYs Across HFXO Frequencies (RAIL 3)
description: >
  Utility to include built-in (Standards based) PHYs. On EFR32XG24, EFR32XG26
  and SixG301 parts, 38.4 MHz, 39 MHz, and 40 Mhz HFXO support is provided by
  this component.
package: rail_library
category: Platform|Radio
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    id: sl_rail_util_built_in_phys
    name: RAIL Utility, Built-in PHYs Across HFXO Frequencies (RAIL 3)
    license: Zlib
documentation:
  docset: rail
  document: rail-api/rail-util-built-in-phys
